      "_id": "78430b87e76f1854",
      "name": "Newsnet — Successful Recovery",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<blockquote><p><strong>KSAF NEWSNET —</strong> Simsense superstar <strong>Euphoria</strong> was recovered unharmed today after what MegaMedia Entertainment calls \"a private security matter.\" The megastar's spokesperson thanked \"the professionals who brought her home\" and confirmed she is resting in seclusion. MegaMedia declined to comment on rumors linking the incident to the snack-food maker <strong>Strice Foods</strong> and its runaway hit <em>Amber Gel</em>.</p></blockquote> <p><em>Hand out on a clean rescue.</em></p>"
      },
