    {
      "_id": "bf9f113ac66ad357",
      "name": "The Simsense Recording (penthouse clue)",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><em>Playback, first person, Euphoria's point of view:</em> the studio lights, a joke half-spoken — then the wall gives way. Something huge and <strong>wrong</strong> comes through: chitin, too many angles, a smell like an anthill and acid. Screams that are cut short. The recording jars, tilts, and a clawed, glistening limb fills the frame before everything lurches and goes to static.</p> <p><em>Hand out (edited) when the team recovers and plays the penthouse simchip.</em></p>"
      },
